<title>JAPAN: Kojima plans briefing on launch of Apple PC clone.</title>
<headline>Kojima plans briefing on launch of Apple PC clone.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electrical appliance retailer Kojima Co Ltd said it would hold a news conference at 1.30 p.m. (0430 GMT) on Thursday about selling a clone of Apple Computer Inc's desktop personal computer Performa.</p>
</text>
